# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to it).
# The image only needs approve-app/; everything else is mounted at /repo at runtime.
# Keeps local builds from uploading shops/ (node_modules, photos) and the secrets.
*
!approve-app/
approve-app/node_modules/
approve-app/.next/
approve-app/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
